The first invariant residual is not a grading issue: the reference semantics branches on whether an abstract local map might be a closure-cell frame. I’m repairing the program/invariant shape by initializing the loop variable before the loop, making the function’s local map exact and eliminating that irrelevant symbolic aliasing branch. This preserves behavior and keeps fixed semantics execution intact.
apply patch
